# Final renders are 150-230 MB each by delivery spec (8-12 Mbps H.264 for a
# 178 s part). GitHub hard-rejects any file over 100 MB and git-lfs is not
# available here, so the masters cannot be tracked in this repo. They are
# delivered directly instead; regenerate with `npm run setup && npm run render:partN`.
out/*.mp4
out/*.zip
